nobs installed and configured\n1. Click on a story\n1. select the a11y tab\n1. select another story\n1. See that the selected tab is now actions\n\n**Expected behavior**\nlast selected tab should remain selected and active.\n\nif i had a11y selected, it should remain selected but updated with info about newly selected story.\n\n**Screenshots**\n![2019-03-14!UNITO-UNDERSCORE!10-29-58](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/61225/54322193-2d1b6000-4644-11e9-9c64-a26cfed5c04b.gif)\n\n**System:**\n\n\n* OS: Windows10 (but our storybook runs in docker)\n* Device: n/a\n* Browser: Chrome Version 72.0.3626.121 (Official Build) (64-bit)\n* Framework: React\n* Addons: Actions, A11y, Knobs\n* Version: 5.0.1\n\n**Additional context**\n\n**`package.json`**\n\n```\n...\n  \"dependencies\": {\n    \"@babel/core\": \"7.2.2\",\n    \"@babel/polyfill\": \"^7.0.0\",\n    \"@storybook/react\": \"5.0.1\",\n    \"@storybook/addon-actions\": \"5.0.1\",\n    \"@storybook/addon-knobs\": \"5.0.1\",\n    \"@storybook/addon-links\": \"5.0.1\",\n    \"@storybook/addon-storysource\": \"5.0.1\",\n    \"@storybook/addon-a11y\": \"5.0.1\",\n    \"storybook-host\": \"5.0.3\",\n    \"storybook-addon-jsx\": \"6.0.0\",\n    \"axios\": \"^0.18.0\",\n    \"babel-loader\": \"8.0.5\",\n    \"babel-plugin-require-context-hook\": \"1.0.0\",\n    \"eslint\": \"^5.5.0\",\n    \"eslint-config-airbnb\": \"^17.1.0\",\n    \"eslint-config-prettier\": \"^3.0.1\",\n    \"eslint-plugin-import\": \"^2.14.0\",\n    \"eslint-plugin-jsx-a11y\": \"^6.1.1\",\n    \"eslint-plugin-prettier\": \"^2.6.2\",\n    \"eslint-plugin-react\": \"^7.11.1\",\n    \"formstate\": \"^1.0.2\",\n    \"gatsby\": \"2.1.14\",\n    \"gatsby-cli\": \"2.4.11\",\n    \"gatsby-image\": \"^2.0.29\",\n    \"gatsby-plugin-manifest\": \"^2.0.18\",\n    \"gatsby-plugin-offline\": \"^2.0.24\",\n    \"gatsby-plugin-react-helmet\": \"^3.0.6\",\n    \"gatsby-plugin-sharp\": \"^2.0.21\",\n    \"gatsby-source-filesystem\": \"^2.0.21\",\n    \"gatsby-plugin-